    q(AE, ANAL, 3, "Dilute nitric acid and then silver nitrate solution are added to a solution. A cream precipitate forms. Which ion is present?",
      ["Chloride", "Bromide", "Iodide", "Sulfate"], "B",
      "With acidified silver nitrate, chloride ions give a white precipitate, bromide ions a cream precipitate and iodide ions a yellow precipitate."),
